1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Until October 7, you and other Israelis helped drive people from Gaza to hospitals in Israel. Will you work for dialogue and cooperation again?

2
00:00:12,266 --> 00:00:13,366
It's useless,

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,100
It's not doing anything.

4
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:22,800
And there is a war now,

5
00:00:25,533 --> 00:00:27,900
and it's a right war, I'm sorry to say.

6
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,466
But it's a right war.

7
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:35,833
There's no other way.

8
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:38,166
It's hard,

9
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,300
I'm crying a lot about it,

10
00:00:42,466 --> 00:00:43,900
but it has to be. 

11
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:47,200
The IDF is doing what they have to do now.

12
00:00:47,933 --> 00:00:52,066
I hope when... and it will finish soon,

13
00:00:52,666 --> 00:00:55,566
we will call and see if we'll be back.

14
00:00:58,433 --> 00:01:02,433
We will start over to talk about

15
00:01:02,433 --> 00:01:04,666
not about peace, about life.

16
00:01:08,133 --> 00:01:10,966
And I don't think that

17
00:01:11,633 --> 00:01:14,366
Derech Hachlama (medical transport charity) 

18
00:01:14,366 --> 00:01:15,300
will be helpful.

19
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,700
They have to do it in their own country.

20
00:01:17,866 --> 00:01:19,700
Someone else has to do it.

21
00:01:22,366 --> 00:01:25,066
We failed, we failed. 

22
00:01:25,066 --> 00:01:29,266
My generation failed to make a safe place.

23
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:31,833
Know the reason.

24
00:01:31,833 --> 00:01:35,966
New generations and new leaders have to grow up

25
00:01:37,366 --> 00:01:40,600
and take us to good places.

